  (69, 'Leg Curl', 'Hamstring Curl, Lying Leg Curl',
   'Lie face down on leg curl machine with ankles under pads. Curl heels toward glutes, squeezing hamstrings at top. Lower with control. Keep hips pressed to pad throughout.',
   NULL),

